            "target_entity_instance": "Southern Ocean",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "LSCE-FFNN computed negative trends over most of the Atlantic basin, the Indian Ocean and south of 40\u00b0 S, which contrasts with decreasing fluxes over the Pacific and locally in the Antarctic Circumpolar Current. At first order, this broad regional pattern is found in all models.",
